# [vg_refused_fallback] post cut (VIRT-GEOM step 29; UE Nanite two-pass: the main pass tests occlusion only when the
# post pass runs): the main view's post-occlusion cluster cut refused, DECIDED BEFORE the main cut
# (SceneRenderer::FrameDrawBins::ClusterMainTestsHzb, Debug.ForceVirtualGeometryPostCutRefusal) - the main cut tests no
# HZB, holds nothing back, and draws every visible cluster in phase 1: a picture equal to VG off, nothing lost.
